iyuan, Sungang and Nanhu (59); Qianhai (38); Chegongmiao and Xiangmihu (23); Shekou and Prince Bay (22); Bao'an Centre, Xin'an (22); Shenzhen Bay Super Headquarters, Shahe (21); Xili (19); Longhua, Minzhi (19); Shuibei and Cuizhu (18); Huaqiangbei (12); Upperhills, Huafu (11); Taoyuan (11); Bao'an: Xixiang, Hongfa QCC (7); Meilin (6); Overseas Chinese Town, OCT One (5); Pingshan: Kengzi (5); Shekou west, Hengyu Bincheng (5). Skylines that almost touch are joined (towers up to 1.9 km apart, rivers up to 600 m wide), so the nineteen pockets here make three skylines. Pieces of one pocket that water cut apart are joined across it too. The other 67 of the city's 536 towers stand in groups too small or too spread out to count. Shekou, Bao'an, Xili and Longhua qualify on density too. Nanshan and Futian join through Jindi Century at Overseas Chinese Town and the Antosan Headquarters towers on the way to Xiangmihu.","towers_in_core":469,"completed_in_core":405,"towers_in_city":536,"share":0.875,"area_km2":73.81,"tallest_in_core":"Ping An Finance Center (599 m)"},"geometry":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[113.91023,22.47695],[113.90978,22.47661],[113.9096,22.47596],[113.90972,22.47569],[113.91073,22.47498],[113.91092,22.47394],[113.91033,22.47313],[113.90965,22.47146],[113.90889,22.4709],[113.90823,22.47084],[113.9066,22.47149],[113.90392,22.47467],[113.90345,22.47681],[113.90408,22.4794],[113.90491,22.48097],[113.90526,22.48215],[113.90515,22.48594],[113.90677,22.48893],[113.90749,22.48966],[113.90914,22.49052],[113.9101,22.49124],[113.91282,22.49485],[113.91439,22.50178],[113.91395,22.50327],[113.91383,22.50524],[113.9134,22.50681],[113.91279,22.50792],[113.91163,22.50927],[113.91092,22.51104],[113.90995,22.51246],[113.90739,22.51449],[113.89441,22.52037],[113.89153,22.52075],[113.88983,22.52072],[113.88876,22.52106],[113.88775,22.52198],[113.88549,22.52592],[113.88403,22.52663],[113.88354,22.52706],[113.88331,22.52767],[113.88341,22.52825],[113.88501,22.53082],[11